</script></div></section><div class="banner"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer m-main-container w-container"><div class="div-block-403"><div class="banner-text-wrapper"><div class="cta-header">Amplify your expertise in <strong>reviewing &amp; drafting contracts</strong></div></div><div class="btn-box"><a href="/contact" class="button-primary bookbtn w-button">Book Demo</a><a href="/trial" class="button-primary w-button">Start Trial</a></div></div></div></div><section class="footer-dark"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer m-main-container w-container"><div class="div-block-312"><div class="div-block-290"><a href="/" class="w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/637d1184b6b77204d212405c/63822c329f78ed760cca7f16_ContractKen%20(1).avif" loading="lazy" alt="contractken"/></a><div class="div-block-294"><div class="text-block-174">Backed by:</div><a href="https://www.upekkha.io/" target="_blank" class="w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/637d1184b6b77204d212405c/6968a70039333b922d77bfb1_upekka.avif" loading="lazy" alt="upekkha" class="image-116"/></a></div></div><div id="w-node-a9783e30-e392-14e8-4999-dfdc0b7a24da-0b7a24d0" class="w-layout-layout quick-stack-7 wf-layout-layout"><div class="w-layout-cell"><div><strong class="bold-text-42">Products</strong></div><ul role="list" class="list-14"><li class="list-item-47"><a href="https://marketplace.microsoft.com/en-us/product/office/WA200003523" target="_blank" class="link-19">Install Word Add-in</a></li><li class="list-item-47"><a href="/review" class="link-19">Review</a></li><li class="list-item-47"><a href="/draft" class="link-19">Draft</a></li><li class="list-item-47"><a href="/formatting" class="link-19">Formatting</a></li><li class="list-item-47"><a href="/playbooks" class="link-19">Playbooks</a></li><li class="list-item-47"><a href="/clause-library" class="link-19">Clause Library</a></li><li class="list-item-47"><a href="/product-demos" class="link-19">Product Demos</a><